{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvV29sZiUyMCUyODE5OTQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Wolf","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/itfb9DhJrUUyGFk63HDdmWenlzw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dAFKnTzyOBbZyRCAb33F632ctva.jpg","description":"Aging publisher Will Randall is at the end of his rope when a younger co-worker snatches his job out from under his nose. But after being bitten by a wolf, Will suddenly finds himself full of youthful vigor. As he struggles to regain his position, he becomes enthralled with Laura Alden, his former boss's daughter. And, as increasingly animal-like urges begin to overwhelm him, Randall worries that he may be turning into the creature that bit him.","releaseInfo":"1994","genres":["Horror","Drama","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"125 min","cast":["Jack Nicholson","Michelle Pfeiffer","James Spader","Kate Nelligan","Richard Jenkins","Christopher Plummer","Eileen Atkins","David Hyde Pierce"],"director":["Mike Nichols"],"released":"1994-06-17T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The animal is out.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jack Nicholson","character":"Will Randall","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6h12pZsgj3WWjMtykUgfLkLEBWz.jpg"},{"name":"Michelle Pfeiffer","character":"Laura Alden","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8qwNMFzmM3BxGKIj1iIqiHHBpx3.jpg"},{"name":"James Spader","character":"Stewart Swinton","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3gurW3OgDOD4hcqDfgcqUnoNg34.jpg"},{"name":"Kate Nelligan","character":"Charlotte Randall","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/a2BUOy9A9WlvTfe8s4gn0MZfPa5.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Jenkins","character":"Detective Carl Bridger","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/muT3RZG9hiKaKojD751RcQ5tGEy.jpg"},{"name":"Christopher Plummer","character":"Raymond Alden","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u0YBwss0ebEUp8sjRtQKnK2wZdR.jpg"},{"name":"Eileen Atkins","character":"Mary","photo":"https://